---
config:
  theme: default
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: '#ffcc00'
    primaryTextColor: '#003366'
    lineColor: '#008800'
    secondaryColor: '#99ccff'
    tertiaryColor: '#ffe6f0'
    background: '#fff2cc'
description: >-
  baseline/themes/default.mmd, the representative gantt, under base-colour overrides in the default theme
  (#1035, D656): the bars keep v12 default's #ececff under the primaryColor override (mainBkg, D657), the
  first section band its #f9ffec under tertiaryColor (bandBkg) and the active outline and
  vert marker its #333333 under lineColor (guideLineColor), as in v12
---
gantt
  title Release plan
  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  excludes weekends
  section Design
    Research          :done, d1, 2024-01-02, 3d
    Sketches          :active, d2, after d1, 3d
  section Build
    Core              :crit, b1, 2024-01-08, 5d
    Docs              :b2, after d2, 4d
    Review            :crit, active, b3, after b1, 2d
  section Ship
    Freeze            :vert, f1, 2024-01-12, 0d
    Release           :milestone, r1, after b3, 0d
    Announce          :done, r2, after r1, 2d
